SUMMARY:Grease: The Lawyer Show Fundraiser
DESCRIPTION:With a hip-shaking rock ’n’ roll score featuring hits like “Summer Nights\,” “Greased Lightnin’” and “We Go Together\,” Grease celebrates Rydell High’s class of 1959 in all their duck-tailed\, bobby-soxed\, gum-snapping glory. \nNightwood Theatre is proud to present one of the most celebrated musicals of all time\, Grease\, as their 2026 Lawyer Show. For over a decade\, this annual fundraiser has hosted hundreds of legal professionals as they venture on stage in support of extraordinary Canadian theatre. Every year up to 40 members of the legal community rehearse for three months to stage an exhilarating\, entertaining production\, led by a team of professional directors\, designers and vocal coaches. Catch this limited run of Grease\, a silent auction\, and 50/50 tickets this June!
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/grease-the-lawyer-show-fundraiser/
LOCATION:St. Lawrence Centre for the Arts\, 27 Front St E\, Old Toronto\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5E 1B4
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Opera
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/grease-the-lawyer-show-fundraiser.jpg
END:VEVENT
