SUMMARY:Players Toronto: 'Schitt's Rivalry'
DESCRIPTION:Part sketch comedy\, part rock concert\, part keg party – and all for charity! Players is excited to present: Schitt’s Rivalry. \nShow Description: \nWe’re going to the Cottage\, David! An all-Canadian showdown between the Rose family\, and hockey’s hottest studs and their buds. Hockey\, hot tubs\, canoes and cottage wars. \nWill real estate ruin relationships or will the biggest dock win? As things get heated up in cottage country\, some will fall in love\, and some will be sent to the penalty box. \nWe’re lumber-jacked for this summer’s Players show: Schitt’s Rivalry! \nThe Cast: Anjali Mulligan\, Brennah Toews\, Emily Ferrier\, Jason Marshall\, Kirk McCullough\, Lance Oribello\, Mike Jankovich\, Stefania D’Amario
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/players-toronto-schitts-rivalry/
LOCATION:Comedy Bar Danforth\, 2800 Danforth Avenue\, Toronto\, M4C 1M1
CATEGORIES:Comedy & Improv,Live Music,Performing Arts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/players-toronto-schitts-rivalry-scaled.jpg
