SUMMARY:Fierce & Fabulous Expo
DESCRIPTION:Fierce & Fabulous Expo is Canada’s first large-scale drag and music convention\, taking place June 5 & 6\, 2026 at the Metro Toronto Convention Centre. Created in support of the You Do You Foundation\, the Expo brings together drag performers\, live music\, fashion\, and community for a celebration of queer artistry. \nHighlights include electrifying drag and live music performances\, the “Lavender Lane” fashion runway\, meet-and-greets with performers\, and the “Love & Learn” panel and workshop series exploring diversity\, inclusion\, and queer arts. The lineup features top performers from Drag Race and artists from So Fierce Music\, Canada’s premiere 2SLGBTQ+ music label. \nEarly Bird tickets are available through April 30th. Exhibitor and sponsorship applications are also open.
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/fierce-fabulous-expo/
LOCATION:Metro Toronto Convention Centre\, 255 Front St W\, Toronto\, ON M5V 2W6\, Canada\, Old Toronto\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5V 2W6
CATEGORIES:2SLGBTQ+,Exhibitions,Live Music,Talks & Panels
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/fierce-fabulous-expo-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
