SUMMARY:Mabuhay Scarborough: Filipino Fiesta
DESCRIPTION:For the first time ever\, Scarborough Town Centre (STC) is celebrating the vibrancy and traditions of Filipino culture with Mabuhay Scarborough: Filipino Fiesta\, a three-day event\, in collaboration with Scarborough Spots\, bringing together community\, creativity and cultural expression from June 5 to 7.   \nRooted in the diversity of Scarborough\, home to one of the country’s largest Filipino communities\, the event highlights the traditions\, talent and stories of this rich culture through immersive experiences\, local vendors and live programming. Shopping centre guests are invited to explore a curated Filipino market\, enjoy cultural performances\, capture moments at a custom Jeepney (traditional Filipino commuter vehicle) photo installation and take part in a live podcast recording by Tita Salita\, a popular Filipino-Canadian podcast star.
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/mabuhay-scarborough-filipino-fiesta/
LOCATION:Scarborough Town Centre\, 300 Borough Dr\, Scarborough\, ON M1P 4P5\, Canada\, Scarborough\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M1P 4P5
CATEGORIES:Community Events,Cultural Celebrations,Food & Drink
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/mabuhay-scarborough-filipino-fiesta.png
END:VEVENT
