SUMMARY:Escape Tour - The Missing Cup Adventure
DESCRIPTION:The trophy has been stolen\, and the clock is ticking. \nThis immersive mission starts off as a tour of downtown Toronto and quickly transforms into a giant outdoor escape game — blending a guided city experience with a high-stakes investigation. \nFollow clues\, solve puzzles\, and find the cup. \nLed by professional actors and designed for real-world interaction. \nWhat to Expect\n• A live\, actor-led experience that guides you through the streets of downtown Toronto• A story-driven mission inspired by the World Cup\, with a clear goal and rising tension• A mix of clues\, puzzles\, and interactive moments as the mission unfolds• Light walking and an accessible pace suitable for most participants• A fun\, memorable way to experience downtown Toronto during the World Cup \nWho This Is For\n• Visitors looking for a unique way to experience Toronto during the World Cup• Locals who want to be part of the World Cup atmosphere in a fun\, interactive way• Solo participants\, couples\, friends\, and small groups looking for something different to do• Football fans and non-fans alike — no prior knowledge needed• Anyone open to joining others and being part of a shared experience \nKey Details\n• Duration: Approximately 75 minutes• Walking Distance: Light walking (1km)• Group Size: Each time slot has 20 spots. (for a private game for your group\, visit our website)• Language: English• What to Bring: Just a smartphone and comfortable shoes \nA Limited-Time Experience\nThis experience is designed specifically for the World Cup period in Toronto. \nWith limited availability and a set number of sessions\, early booking is recommended. \nReady to take on the mission?\nStep into the story and see if you can recover the World Cup trophy before time runs out.
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/escape-tour-world-cup-mission/
LOCATION:Victoria Memorial Square\, Victoria Memorial Square\, 10 Niagara St\, Toronto\, ON M5V 1C2\, Canada\, Old Toronto\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5V 1C2
CATEGORIES:Games & Trivia,Toronto26 (Soccer Celebration),Tours
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/escape-tour-the-missing-cup-adventure.png
END:VEVENT
