SUMMARY:PA Days at MOCA
DESCRIPTION:What’s your favourite sport? \nThis PA Day\, get inspired by the exciting sporting events in Toronto this summer and MOCA’s current exhibitions. Visit the museum and design merchandise\, uniforms\, pennants and more! Use your imagination\, colourful felt and glue to create your original and unique designs.  \nWe invite children grades K–8\, supervised by an adult\, to drop by and join the fun! All athletes\, aspiring\, retired\, imagined or even professional\, are welcome.  \nThis activity is free with admission. Book ahead\, or acquire your ticket at the door.
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/pa-days-at-moca/
LOCATION:158 Sterling Rd.\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada\, Ontario M5R 2B7\, 158 Sterling Rd\, Toronto\, ON M6R 2B7\, Canada\, Toronto\, M6R 2B7
CATEGORIES:Art & Design,Kids & Family
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/pa-days-at-moca.jpg
END:VEVENT
