SUMMARY:Melanin Market In The Square
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Black creativity\, entrepreneurship\, and community at the Melanin Market! This special afternoon-to-evening partner presentation features a curated selection of local fashion\, art\, and handcrafted goods from Black-owned businesses. Pull up ready to shop\, move\, and  celebrate as we kick off the first market of the season with an incredible lineup of interactive community activations. \nMelanin Market in the Square dates: June 5\, July 10\, & August 14 \nGo to sankofasquare.ca/hotsquaresummer to see the full season of free weekly events.
