SUMMARY:Taste of North York
DESCRIPTION:NeighbourLink North York presents the 4th Taste of North York Community & Food Festival\, June 5-7 at Mel Lastman Square! \nCelebrate North York’s vibrant cultures\, diverse cuisines and community connections with delicious food vendors\, live music\, dancing\, artisans\, kid’s activities and NeighbourLink’s Community Fair featuring 20+ local organizations. \nKorean\, Chinese\, Persian\, Ukrainian\, South American\, Caribbean\, Filipino\, Brazilian\, Greek and Indian cultures will all be represented! Net proceeds support NeighbourLink’s food banks and community care programs. \nThere will be family activities including giant games\, caricatures\, facepainting\, aerial hammocks\, mini-golf and more! \nDon’t forget to bring a non-perishable food item to cram a 32 division police cruiser and support NeighbourLink’s food bank! \nJoin in the fun of building a more connected community together! \nLearn more at www.neighbourlink.org/taste
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/taste-of-north-york/
LOCATION:Mel Lastman Square\, 5100 Yonge St\, North York\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M2N 5V7
CATEGORIES:Community Events,Cultural Celebrations,Festivals,Food & Drink
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/taste-of-north-york.jpg
END:VEVENT
